}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Sqrt[5] is the pentagon's analogue of the Tsirelson bound: the most a genuine \
quantum device can score. 5/2 is its analogue of the no-signaling ceiling: \
the most reachable while still respecting no-disturbance. The strip between \
them \[LongDash] the 'meta-optics' overhang \[LongDash] is the adversary's \
room, and it is the territory this whole project is built to survey.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"182a2011-8a1f-7942-8919-671511ff59c7"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Map of the Work \[LongDash] Objectives, Stages, and Verified Numbers", \
"Section",ExpressionUUID->"090b67f9-f0aa-1a47-bbc5-b8c04f03afd1"],

Cell["\<\
O1 correlation-based classification of statistics \[Rule] Stages 1-2, 4 \
(GE-001, CF-001..004).
O2 Lie-algebraic resource scaling \[Rule] Stages 5-6 (LP-002).
O3 conditions for indistinguishability \[Rule] Stages 3-4 (BBT-002, BBT-004).
O4 Hawking illustration \[Rule] The Cherry on Top (HK-003, HK-006, HK-007).
O5 signaling / communication feasibility \[Rule] Stage 13 (SIG-001..003).
Priority: AB-sheaf derivation of the composed bound \[Rule] Stage 12 \
(ESSAY-005, SH-006).
D1: GE copies vs \[Theta](G) \[Rule] Stages 10-11 (GE-002..004, ERG-003).
MESH: pentagon gluing \[Rule] Stages 7-8 (MESH-001..009, CERT-001..002).
MBQC: cluster-state realization \[Rule] Stage 9 (MESH-007..008, LP-003).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8d6cea73-8a86-1240-b2fa-9be0ad96542c"],

Cell["\<\
Results at a glance (every number kernel-verified in a module):
Classical 2 < quantum \[Sqrt]5 = 2.2360679775 < NCHV 5/2 (GE-001); contextual \
fraction 2\[Sqrt]5 - 4 = 0.4721.
Gluing limit densities: trans tau* = 1.3767177459, cis = 3/2; best word \
(cct)^inf gap 0.0698975 per block, beating pure-trans by 61%.
Epsilon-certificate ladder Gamma_7..Gamma_10 = 0.0770206, 0.0752664, \
0.0720260, 0.0714575, bracketing gap(cct).
Catalysis: \[Omega](C9^v3) = 8 proven; \[Omega](C9 v C9 v C9 v C5) \
\[GreaterEqual] 17 (17-clique witness, family [1,3,5,5,3]).
Geometric lens: single so(3) generator DLA = 1 (leaf) vs full cascade DLA = 3 \
(sphere); CV Hawking generator DLA = 10 = sp(4,R), active.
Signaling: SF(C5, quantum) = 2\[Sqrt]5 - 4 bits per round.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6ed78287-11ba-eb44-81fe-9547f27ae1bf"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Part I \[LongDash] The Atom and the Two-Lens Certificate", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"a79a4fb1-a6b2-d244-ba1e-b5ee394b8124"],

Cell["\<\
The central question, the KCBS-pentagon atom, and the two lenses that certify \
it: the correlation lens (the three-number ruler \[Alpha], \[Theta], \
\[Alpha]*) and the geometric lens (the dynamical Lie algebra), joined by the \
black-box protocol and its constructive mirror, the optical compiler. \
Modules: Stages 0-6. Objectives O1, O2, O3; tracks D2, BBT, EMU.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0e24ec4e-42e5-264e-9250-78f3dfb65e94"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Stage 0 \[LongDash] The Question: The Sealed Box", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fb1f35a4-e379-a54f-a25d-9366bb9c94d2"],

Cell["\<\
Imagine a sealed box with some inputs and outputs. It behaves in ways that \
look quantum: its outputs show correlations no ordinary classical device \
should be able to produce. Can you ever be completely certain it is genuinely \
quantum, just by watching what goes in and out, without opening it \
\[LongDash] or could a clever engineer build a purely classical fake that \
produces the exact same numbers? That is the founding question, and the \
honest starting picture has two possible interiors behind one identical \
stream of clicks.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2da1ecd2-754a-224e-b7ca-6011d724d231"],

Cell["\<\
A device you can only poke from outside: same clicks, two candidate interiors:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"5d6c4dc9-6bab-564a-9d96-d413f352b0d7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Module[{bx, navy = RGBColor[0.16, 0.28, 0.46], amber = RGBColor[0.80, 0.50, 0.18], ink = GrayLevel[0.18]},\n bx = Function[{x, lbl, guts}, {\n    {GrayLevel[0.14], EdgeForm[{GrayLevel[0.5], Thickness[0.004]}],\n     Rectangle[{x - 0.95, -0.8}, {x + 0.95, 0.8}]}, guts,\n    White, Text[Style[lbl, 8, FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\", Bold], {x, 0.6}]}];\n Graphics[{\n   bx[-2.4, \"interior A: genuinely quantum\",\n    {Lighter[navy, 0.35], Disk[{-2.4, 0.05}, 0.16],\n     White, Text[Style[\"γ\", 13, FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\"], {-2.4, 0.05}],\n     GrayLevel[0.85], Text[Style[\"single photon\", 8, FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\"], {-2.4, -0.45}]}],\n   bx[2.4, \"interior B: classical light\",\n    {amber, Thickness[0.018],\n     Line[{{1.95, 0.3}, {2.85, -0.25}}], Line[{{1.95, -0.25}, {2.85, 0.3}}],\n     GrayLevel[0.85], Text[Style[\"intensity optics\", 8, FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\"], {2.4, -0.55}]}],\n   Arrowheads[0.03], GrayLevel[0.5],\n   Arrow[{{-2.4, 1.5}, {-2.4, 0.85}}], Arrow[{{2.4, 1.5}, {2.4, 0.85}}],\n   ink, Text[Style[\"same measurement in\", 9, FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\"], {0, 1.4}],\n   GrayLevel[0.5], Arrow[{{-2.4, -0.85}, {-2.4, -1.5}}], Arrow[{{2.4, -0.85}, {2.4, -1.5}}],\n   ink, Text[Style[\"identical click statistics out — can you tell which?\", 10, Bold, FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\"], {0, -1.75}]\n   }, ImageSize -> 480, PlotRange -> {{-3.9, 3.9}, {-2.0, 1.6}}]\n]", "Input", CellOpen -> False, CellLabel -> "In[737]:=", ExpressionUUID -> "9d5781e3-a59b-49fe-b13b-0c53aa3a9804"],

Cell[BoxData[GraphicsBox[{{{GrayLevel[0.14], EdgeForm[{GrayLevel[0.5], Thickness[0.004]}], RectangleBox[{-3.3499999999999996, -0.8}, {-1.45, 0.8}]}, {RGBColor[0.45399999999999996, 0.532, 0.649], DiskBox[{-2.4, 0.05}, 0.16], GrayLevel[1], InsetBox[FormBox[StyleBox["\"γ\"", 13, FontFamily -> "Helvetica", StripOnInput -> False], TraditionalForm], {-2.4, 0.05}], GrayLevel[0.85], InsetBox[FormBox[StyleBox["\"single photon\"", 8, FontFamily -> "Helvetica", StripOnInput -> False], TraditionalForm], {-2.4, -0.45}]}, GrayLevel[1], InsetBox[FormBox[StyleBox["\"interior A: genuinely quantum\"", 8, FontFamily -> "Helvetica", Bold, StripOnInput -> False], TraditionalForm], {-2.4, 0.6}]}, {{GrayLevel[0.14], EdgeForm[{GrayLevel[0.5], Thickness[0.004]}], RectangleBox[{1.45, -0.8}, {3.3499999999999996, 0.8}]}, {RGBColor[0.8, 0.5, 0.18], Thickness[0.018], LineBox[{{1.95, 0.3}, {2.85, -0.25}}], LineBox[{{1.95, -0.25}, {2.85, 0.3}}], GrayLevel[0.85], InsetBox[FormBox[StyleBox["\"intensity optics\"", 8, FontFamily -> "Helvetica", StripOnInput -> False], TraditionalForm], {2.4, -0.55}]}, GrayLevel[1], InsetBox[FormBox[StyleBox["\"interior B: classical light\"", 8, FontFamily -> "Helvetica", Bold, StripOnInput -> False], TraditionalForm], {2.4, 0.6}]}, Arrowheads[0.03], GrayLevel[0.5], ArrowBox[{{-2.4, 1.5}, {-2.4, 0.85}}], ArrowBox[{{2.4, 1.5}, {2.4, 0.85}}], GrayLevel[0.18], InsetBox[FormBox[StyleBox["\"same measurement in\"", 9, FontFamily -> "Helvetica", StripOnInput -> False], TraditionalForm], {0, 1.4}], GrayLevel[0.5], ArrowBox[{{-2.4, -0.85}, {-2.4, -1.5}}], ArrowBox[{{2.4, -0.85}, {2.4, -1.5}}], GrayLevel[0.18], InsetBox[FormBox[StyleBox["\"identical click statistics out — can you tell which?\"", 10, Bold, FontFamily -> "Helvetica", StripOnInput -> False], TraditionalForm], {0, -1.75}]}, ImageSize -> 480, PlotRange -> {{-3.9, 3.9}, {-2., 1.6}}]], "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[737]=", ExpressionUUID -> "2c9a2e39-de18-4785-810a-c0218db05556"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The rest of the essay is the sustained attempt to tell A from B \[LongDash] \
first with statistics, then, where statistics provably cannot, with geometry. \
To do that cleanly we need the simplest possible box where A and B already \
differ at all.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"776b3fb1-8cab-d84b-a554-85e3bd17b0c0"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Stage 1 \[LongDash] The Atom: the KCBS Pentagon", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0155e221-72ef-2740-8036-f6fc468288cb"],

Cell["\<\
You do not want a complicated device to study this; you want the smallest one \
where 'quantum' and 'classical' already come apart. That object is the KCBS \
pentagon: five measurements arranged so each one is ever only compared with \
its two neighbours [3]. Joining mutually-exclusive measurements by an edge \
draws exactly a five-cycle.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"56e689ba-6ae8-c34a-acd9-162343ed4e8f"],

Cell["\<\
The exclusivity graph of the five KCBS events is the five-cycle itself:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"2663e832-b2fc-7d4e-ade4-25d69a5b0355"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"c2", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "5"}], "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "5"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], " "}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"vecs", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "c2"}], "]"}], "*", 
         RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
          RowBox[{"4", "*", "Pi", "*", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"i", "/", "5"}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "c2"}], "]"}], "*", 
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
          RowBox[{"4", "*", "Pi", "*", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"i", "/", "5"}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "c2", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  " "}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"stateVec", "[", "beta_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "beta", "]"}], ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "beta", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], " "}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"probsQ", "[", "beta_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"N", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"stateVec", "[", "beta", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
          RowBox[{"vecs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", 
            RowBox[{"i", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "^", 
        "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  " "}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"edgesP", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], " "}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Manipulate", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "selC", ",", " ", "violC", ",", " ", "scoreC", ",", " ", "vcolC", ",", 
       " ", "ecolC", ",", " ", "msgC", ",", " ", "colC", ",", " ", "p", ",", 
       " ", "totalQ", ",", " ", "vcolQ", ",", " ", "ivals", ",", " ", "violI",
        ",", " ", "totalI", ",", " ", "vcolI", ",", " ", "ecolI", ",", " ", 
       "msgI", ",", " ", "colI", ",", " ", "panelC", ",", " ", "\n", "    ", 
       "panelQ", ",", " ", "panelI"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"selC", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Position", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
            "b0", ",", " ", "b1", ",", " ", "b2", ",", " ", "b3", ",", " ", 
             "b4"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "True"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
        "1"}]}], ";", " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"violC", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
        RowBox[{"edgesP", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"selC", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"#1", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"selC", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"#1", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], " ", "&"}]}], " ", 
        "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"scoreC", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", "selC", "]"}]}], ";", " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"msgC", ",", " ", "colC"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "violC", "]"}], " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<illegal\>\"", ",", " ", "Red"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<score = \>\"", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "scoreC", "]"}], ",", 
             " ", "\"\< (ceiling 2)\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", "\n", "       ", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"scoreC", " ", "<=", " ", "2"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Darker", "[", "Green", "]"}], ",", " ", "Orange"}], 
            "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"vcolC", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"i", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{"selC", ",", " ", "i"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Darker", "[", "Green", "]"}], ",", " ", "LightGray"}], 
           "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"ecolC", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"UndirectedEdge", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"edgesP", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"k", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"edgesP", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"k", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{"violC", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"edgesP", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "k", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", "Red", ",", 
            " ", "Gray"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "5"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", "\n", 
      "    ", 
      RowBox[{"panelC", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Graph", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"UndirectedEdge", " ", "@@@", " ", "edgesP"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"VertexLabels", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Name\>\""}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{"VertexStyle", " ", "->", " ", "vcolC"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"EdgeStyle", " ", "->", " ", "ecolC"}], ",", " ", "\n", 
            "        ", 
            RowBox[{"VertexSize", " ", "->", " ", "0.3"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
            "GraphLayout", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<CircularEmbedding\>\""}], ",",
             " ", 
            RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "220"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"PlotLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<classical\>\"", ",", " ", "Bold"}], "]"}]}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "\n", "       ", 
          RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "msgC", ",", " ", "colC", ",", " ", "Bold", ",", " ", "11"}], 
           "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"p", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"probsQ", "[", "beta", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"totalQ", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Total", "[", "p", "]"}]}], ";", " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"vcolQ", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"i", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Blend", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"White", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"RGBColor", "[", 
               RowBox[{"0.2", ",", " ", "0.45", ",", " ", "0.85"}], "]"}]}], 
             "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"p", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"i", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"panelQ", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Graph", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"UndirectedEdge", " ", "@@@", " ", "edgesP"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"VertexLabels", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Name\>\""}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{"VertexStyle", " ", "->", " ", "vcolQ"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"VertexSize", " ", "->", " ", "0.3"}], ",", " ", "\n", 
            "        ", 
            RowBox[{
            "GraphLayout", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<CircularEmbedding\>\""}], ",",
             " ", 
            RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "220"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"PlotLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<quantum\>\"", ",", " ", "Bold"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}],
           ",", " ", "\n", "       ", 
          RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<score = \>\"", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
               RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
                RowBox[{"totalQ", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
              " ", "\"\< (max \[Sqrt]5 at \[Beta]=0)\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Darker", "[", "Blue", "]"}], ",", " ", "Bold", ",", " ", 
            "11"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"ivals", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "i0", ",", " ", "i1", ",", " ", "i2", ",", " ", "i3", ",", " ", 
         "i4"}], "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"violI", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
        RowBox[{"edgesP", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ivals", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#1", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], 
             "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ivals", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#1", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], 
             "]"}]}], " ", ">", " ", "1"}], " ", "&"}]}], " ", "]"}]}], ";", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{"totalI", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Total", "[", "ivals", "]"}]}], ";", " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"vcolI", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"i", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Blend", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"White", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"RGBColor", "[", 
               RowBox[{"0.75", ",", " ", "0.2", ",", " ", "0.2"}], "]"}]}], 
             "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ivals", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"i", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      " ", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"ecolI", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"UndirectedEdge", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"edgesP", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"k", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"edgesP", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"k", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
